{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>I have watched:</b> I have watched alone in one place, and no one of my family is with me." "<b>Like a bird:</b> Masculine form; in the Torah it is feminine. So too the word שה is scattered [i.e., varies in gender], except that שה is always [used]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 102, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:46.185342931Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}